| Component | Configuration |
|---|---|
| Operating system | Windows Server 2022 |
| Virtualization | VMware Workstation Pro |
| Domain | Turtle.local |
| Server role | Active Directory Domain Controller |
| Storage management | File Server Resource Manager |
